results.description:
SayEat is a voice calorie counter and smart AI-powered food diary.

SayEat helps you keep a food diary more easily, track calories, macros, and daily progress.

Simply take a photo of your food, describe your meal by voice, or enter it manually — SayEat will help recognize foods, estimate calories, protein, fat, carbohydrates, and save the meal to your diary.

Food Recognition by Photo

No need to spend time searching for foods manually.

Take a photo of your meal, and SayEat will help:

identify foods and ingredients;
estimate portion size;
calculate approximate calories;
show protein, fat, and carbohydrates;
save your meal in just a few seconds.

Voice Food Diary

Add meals in the way that works best for you.

Simply say, for example:
“For breakfast, I had oatmeal with banana and coffee.”

SayEat recognizes the meal description and helps automatically fill in your food diary.

Personal Calorie and Macro Goals

After registration, SayEat takes your data into account:

age;
gender;
height and weight;
activity level;
user goal.

Based on this data, the app helps determine:

approximate daily calorie needs;
balance of protein, fat, and carbohydrates;
estimated calorie deficit or surplus;
personalized tips for keeping a food diary.

Detailed Statistics and Analytics

Track your progress in a convenient format.

The app includes:

calorie statistics;
macro analysis;
water intake tracking;
goal progress dynamics;
food history.

For Different Nutrition Goals

SayEat can be used for different goals:

weight loss;
weight gain;
maintaining current weight;
building more mindful eating habits.

Recipes for Your Goals

Get meal ideas with approximate calculations of:

calories;
protein;
fat;
carbohydrates.

Choose recipes based on your diet, preferences, and nutrition goals.

Why Users Choose SayEat

Food recognition by photo;
voice meal input;
approximate calorie and macro calculations;
personal AI assistant;
detailed progress statistics;
convenient food diary;
quick meal logging in just a few seconds.

Important Information

SayEat provides approximate calculations of calories, macros, and nutritional values for informational purposes only. The app does not provide medical advice and is not a substitute for consultation with a doctor, dietitian, or other healthcare professional.

Privacy Policy: https://sayeat.app/SayEat_Privacy_Policy_EN.pdf
Terms of Use: https://sayeat.app/SayEat_Terms_of_Use_EN.pdf

Start keeping your food diary more easily with SayEat and track your goals with the help of artificial intelligence.
